        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International, Corcoran Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe column styling of RK International's Corcoran Cabinet Door Pull will add a stately presence to any door, be it in the kitchen, the bathroom, or even in the bedroom. Just imagine the elegance that installing this cabinet hardware will exude. Pair dark cabinets with a satin nickel finish for a look that is very now; or go classic with light wood cabinets and this zinc Corcoran Cabinet Pull in a brushed english finish. Available in 3 inch, 5 inch, and 8 inch center to center lengths.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/corcoran-collection-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-140\"><b>Matching Corcoran Cabinet Knob</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>RKI-CP-640:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 3-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 45/64\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-5/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>RKI-CP-641:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 5-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 45/64\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-5/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>RKI-CP-642:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 8-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 45/64\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-5/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-NE10LE1_size.gif?v=1704354556\" width\"443\" height=\"116\" border=\"0\" atl=\"RKI International Fullerton Cabinet Pull Finishes\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
